## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6.2 Astra
- **Short description:** The suspected next-generation successor to GPT-6 Astra; as of November 2026 it appeared only in limited **gray-box/beta testing**, with no official product page, pricing, parameters or release date. A distinct tracked entry; GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6.2 Sol and GPT-6.1 Astra variants are separate.
- **Provider / access:** Not publicly released. Evidence of a gray test: an independent model identifier `gpt-6.2-astra` appearing in some Codex users' usage statistics, and a `GPT-6.2 Astra` option on a Google Cloud console quota page.
- **Release / knowledge:** not released as of 2026-11 (gray test only); knowledge cutoff: no verified public score found.
- **IDs:** `gpt-6.2-astra` (observed identifier only). No free Zen ID verified.
- **Context window:** no verified figure — no verified public score found.
- **Modalities:** no verified information — no verified public score found.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** no published price — no verified public price found.
- **Architecture:** not disclosed. Described only as the next-generation model of the GPT-6 Astra line.

